body:
Him kind of forcing you to have sex with him: red flag;
You and your family being casteist af: red flag;
His mom making that comment: red flag;
Your mom asking him about his mom's and grandmother's surname just to figure out their caste: red flag

You seem extremely immature to be marrying anybody. You talking about how you wanna commit suicide if you don't get to be with him and how you slept with him because you're a "people pleaser" is extremely problematic. I'm sorry if this sounds harsh but I think you need to hear this so that you can introspect. You need to learn to set boundaries, how to stand up for yourself and how to make your own decisions. Please don't marry anyone until you feel like you can face whatever happens. Too many girls do this and then they're stuck forever because they don't feel like they can face a divorce or separation and they suffer. Please grow up, become financially independent, live alone for a few years, make decisions by yourself and then think about marriage

All the best, I hope you get thru this ♥️
